>
    <Section level={3} title="Browse accounts by region">
        <p>Spread <code>tree</code> on your list, and each node's <code>node(node).item</code> on
            it and <code>node(node).group</code> on the list of its children. Focus an item and the arrows move
            through what shows; Right opens a region, Left closes it, and a letter jumps to the next
            name it starts.</p>
        <Example code={accountsByRegion}><AccountsByRegion /></Example>
    </Section>

    <Section level={3} title="Put several accounts in a campaign">
        <p><code>multiple</code> selects many, and <code>selected</code> holds their keys. A click
            picks one account, ⌘ or Ctrl with it adds or takes one out, and Shift takes the run from
            the last one picked; Space, Shift with an arrow and ⌘A or Ctrl+A do the same from the
            keys.</p>
